   1 //! Resumable file copy with block-level hash comparison.
   2 //!
   3 //! Compares existing destination content block-by-block with source using Blake3 hashes,
   4 //! only transferring blocks that differ. This allows resuming interrupted transfers
   5 //! and efficiently updating files with partial changes.
   6 //!
   7 //! Using hash comparison (vs raw bytes) enables the same logic for remote transfers
   8 //! where only hashes are exchanged over the network.
